Formal foundation
-----------------
AION implements the mathematical model described in:

  Matten, F. (2025). AION — Algebraic Interval Ontology for Clinical
  Networks (FM-3, Version 1.0). ISCaD GmbH, 30900 Wedemark.
  https://codeberg.org/fm2-project/cairn

AION is the third paper in the FM series:

  FM-1: Grundlagen zur wissenschaftlichen Auswertung von klinischen
        Informationen (2020). ISCaD GmbH.

  FM-2: CAIRN — Clinical Interoperability Reference Architecture.
        ISCaD GmbH. https://codeberg.org/fm2-project/cairn

  FM-3: AION — Algebraic Interval Ontology for Clinical Networks
        (this software). ISCaD GmbH.

