Scope limitation
----------------
AION is NOT a medical device within the meaning of EU MDR 2017/745
or MPDG. It is a software library for formal modelling, verification,
and analysis of clinical information structures. It does not make
clinical decisions, does not interact with patients, and is not
intended for direct clinical use.

